          "public_tag": "v0.1.0",
          "public_version_rationale": "v0.1.0 is the smallest coherent first public version of this repository: the twenty-one Comparator entries that were selected for the first Palomar launch, at one immutable commit, on one Mathlib pin, with nothing added to round the number up. It is 0.x because the entry set is a queue rather than a finished collection, and because no entry here has been reviewed by a human mathematician.",
